<title>USA: CIGNA Q4 oper shr down.</title>
<headline>CIGNA Q4 oper shr down.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr	   $3.47		    $3.62</p>
<p> Oper net	   261,000		  277,000</p>
<p> Revs		 4,900,000		4,800,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   75,255		   76,425</p>
<p>			TWELVE MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr	   $13.14		   $11.96</p>
<p> Oper net	   1,000,000		882,000</p>
<p> Revs		 19,000,000	     19,000,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   76,248		   73,719</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: First Call Q4 consensus estimate was $3.44 a share.</p>
<p>Q4 net income per share was $4.07 compared with $3.69 a year ago.</p>
<p>1995 operating income of $882 million, or $11.96 a share, excludes third quarter adjustments for asbestos and environmental, reinsurance and cost reduction charges.</p>
<p>Including these adjustments, 1995 operating income was $33 million, or $0.45 a share.</p>
<p>Full year net income was $1.1 billion or $13.85 a share compared with $211 million or $2.86 a share in 1995, including the adjustments.</p>
</text>
